  "about": "Whether a copied text is uploaded as kind link or text. A link is one absolute http or https URL, after trimming, with no whitespace inside. The .NET ContentClassifier (System.Uri) is the reference; the Android ClipCodec.isLink must give the same answer for every case here. Platforms that still disagree on some other input are harmless: the server bumps a text upload onto a stored link and the other way round. Checked by tests/PrivatePaste.Tests/Protocol/ContentClassifierTests.cs and the Android ClipCodecTest.",
